                  "line": 7,
                  "heading": "1. International University Partnerships"
                },
                "text": "Cendara University maintains robust institutional affiliations with leading universities and educational organizations around the world. These partnerships facilitate academic collaboration, research initiatives, faculty exchanges, and student mobility."
